  "verdict": "void",
  "section": "15",
  "quote": "A provision in a tenancy agreement providing that all or part of the remaining rent for a term or period of a tenancy or a specific sum becomes due upon a default of the tenant in paying rent due or in carrying out an obligation is void.",
  "reason": "The clause makes a specific sum of $50 due upon the tenant's default in paying rent on time. Section 15 explicitly makes any provision void if it requires a specific sum to become due upon a default in paying rent."
}

